  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1091722127377444945/1121975179195732068/image.png\" width=\"743\" height=\"203\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>The Seven Seas 是一個添加了許多海盜相關模組的整合包，讓你能夠體驗成為真正海盜的感覺。</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">⛵Small Ships 為遊戲增添了可裝備武器的新船隻</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">🌊Higher World Deeper Ocean 使海洋變得更加深邃</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">🌍Terralith 添加了新的地圖生成機制</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">⚔️BetterCombat 為遊戲增添了新的戰鬥機制與動畫</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">🦬Alex's Mobs 為遊戲添加了新的動物</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🐚Aquamirae 添加了新的盔甲、武器、生物等更多内容</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🦈Upgrade Aquatic 為海洋增添了大量新功能</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">'n much more</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-size:14px\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1091722127377444945/1122037426555191326/picturesblue.png\" width=\"667\" height=\"133\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1091722127377444945/1122047436685328404/whale2.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1091722127377444945/1122047437121523743/ship2.png\"></p>",
